{"title":"Mock AIME 6 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5d3dead9cb8d5f6327c737e014850be7a29d0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> be the largest positive rational solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174ed4ca542387d77d28bdb3a2e7534d2b514994.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2007-x)(x+2007^{-k})^k=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"225\" height=\"20\" /> for all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/e/19e4194d33d81c3dd5ac49c773335504c4a7a0d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />.  For each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/2/772133d7743808d5092c8ce23fffe79b38dc8ee8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k=\\frac{a_k}{b_k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"63\" height=\"35\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/a/bea4d576937a04ec200b1037fc8ee33e8f744cb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6bdec4394870e8a713538ce428bea9d41c8775f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> are relatively prime positive integers.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/5/ea596185766873133fc4bc046e61239d08824be1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S=\\sum_{k=2}^{2007} (2007b_k-a_k),\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"50\" /> what is the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/a/e1a334305d72201dc5bfee2815212669b6edeca1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Solving: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/c/33c132aae19f1657d350a449829955c383334662.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A-x)(x+A^{-k})^k=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"183\" height=\"22\" /> we note that the largest positive rational solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is given by:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/f/61f45c2d40810d3d199eb1cc8f71b5d341cfbdd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k=A-\\frac{1}{A^k}=\\frac{A^{k+1}-1}{A^k}=\\frac{a_k}{b_k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p>Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/f/47f736c247193ba405e88c0eab0f81380a0bf4a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k=A^{k+1}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/a/90ab7b248c17c98c7fcddd9bf4c665d6b81d043f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_k=A^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/1/2d19fadcf81c3651b9a103f7b1a30f3a1ef5fa83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A)(b_k)-a_k=(A)(A^k)-(A^{k+1}-1)=A^{k+1}-A^{k+1}+1=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"482\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/c/a4ca2768941fc95c4dd956cf81b4e56d3c8e111d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=2}^{A} ((A)(b_k)-a_k)=\\sum_{k=2}^{A}1=A-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"271\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/c/32ceb882549d72b4d5390d5e1859238ac15cd5e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=2007-1=2006 \\equiv 6\\;(mod\\;1000)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"295\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Reminder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adb760a2c7143780db481b394ada34e0bb23b3bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~Tomas Diaz. orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p><p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018040557\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 95/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 386/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3910/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.354      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n100.00%    6.354      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:25883:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018040557 and revision id 205980. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}